1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 15=

4
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:02,740
Xiaoyuan.

5
00:01:03,010 --> 00:01:04,200
What's wrong with you?

6
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,840
It's only a cold.

7
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:07,590
Why have you been cooped up
in your room all day?

8
00:01:08,430 --> 00:01:10,000
I'm fine, Your Highness.

9
00:01:10,350 --> 00:01:11,710
(The thirty-fifth cycle)

10
00:01:11,710 --> 00:01:13,400
(is off to a terrible start.)

11
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,760
(It's bad enough
that everything has changed.)

12
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:15,950
(I don't even have a single ally.)

13
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,680
(I don't know where to begin.)

14
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:20,870
But you haven't looked well lately.

15
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:22,480
Have you been sleeping poorly at night?

16
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:26,280
There's a prayer ceremony
at Qingshan Temple tomorrow.

17
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,070
Why don't

18
00:01:27,150 --> 00:01:29,040
you come with me and offer some incense?

19
00:01:29,070 --> 00:01:30,150
You can pray for peace and safety.

20
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:31,040
I don't think...

21
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:33,350
And I heard Boqing
will be there tomorrow too.

22
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,480
He's going to pray
for the soldiers at the front.

23
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,150
I believe

24
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:38,870
with him protecting Great Yue,

25
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,400
we'll surely be safe.

26
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:42,870
You have a point, Your Highness.

27
00:01:43,150 --> 00:01:44,480
Then I'll go offer some incense too.

28
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:46,870
That's more like it.

29
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:58,840
Xiaoyuan.

30
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,840
I'm glad

31
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:03,200
you came to pray for me.

32
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,150
Your Highness,

33
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:13,080
the Taoist priest has important
matters to discuss with you.

34
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,000
Please come with me.

35
00:02:14,150 --> 00:02:14,800
Xiaoyuan.

36
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,280
Go meet up with Yun Fang first.

37
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,280
Let her show you around.

38
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:19,430
I'll come find you later.

39
00:02:20,190 --> 00:02:21,000
All right.

40
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,280
The Princess is having her meal.

41
00:02:39,150 --> 00:02:41,080
I hear wishes made at
the Matchmaker Shrine are often granted.

42
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,750
Would you like to

43
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:44,590
come offer some incense with me?

44
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:48,750
All right.

45
00:02:51,030 --> 00:02:51,630
Follow me.

46
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:55,870
(He really did come.)

47
00:02:56,150 --> 00:02:57,470
(And invited me
to the Matchmaker Shrine.)

48
00:02:57,750 --> 00:02:58,960
(Could he have regained his memories?)

49
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,740
(Matchmaker Hall)

50
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,030
Zhao Boqing.

51
00:03:07,030 --> 00:03:08,820
(Matchmaker Hall)

52
00:03:09,590 --> 00:03:09,870
Do you...

53
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,590
Do you remember this place?

54
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,870
During the last cycle,

55
00:03:13,870 --> 00:03:15,280
Yu Feilin tried to kill me,

56
00:03:15,430 --> 00:03:16,710
and you saved my life here.

57
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,710
What are you talking about?

58
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,430
I don't understand.

59
00:03:25,660 --> 00:03:27,940
(Matchmaker Hall)

60
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:28,360
Then...

61
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:30,030
what about
the Imperial Preceptor, Zhixuan?

62
00:03:30,430 --> 00:03:31,470
Fu Yang's father.

63
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:32,870
They...

64
00:03:32,870 --> 00:03:33,630
Imperial Preceptor?

65
00:03:34,430 --> 00:03:36,280
Great Yue has never
had an Imperial Preceptor.

66
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,310
And Study Companion Fu's father

67
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,470
died of illness when he was very young.

68
00:03:41,030 --> 00:03:41,840
He Xiaoyuan.

69
00:03:42,430 --> 00:03:43,120
Why have you

70
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,240
been saying such strange things today?

71
00:03:45,750 --> 00:03:46,800
(Zhixuan is dead.)

72
00:03:47,150 --> 00:03:48,630
(There was never
an Imperial Preceptor at all.)

73
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,630
(How could this be?)

74
00:03:50,030 --> 00:03:51,000
(Why is everything in this lifetime)

75
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:53,080
(so different from before?)

76
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,680
(This woman
is acting completely irrational.)

77
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,240
(I have no idea)

78
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,590
(what Zhao Junyao sees in her.)

79
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,310
(No matter.)

80
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,280
(She's still an obstacle in my way,)

81
00:04:02,710 --> 00:04:03,800
(and I will get rid of her.)

82
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,030
Your Highness,

83
00:04:07,430 --> 00:04:08,280
since you're already here,

84
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,840
why don't you join me

85
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,840
in lighting an eternal lamp?

86
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,030
(In the last lifetime,)

87
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:16,270
(if Zhao Boqing hadn't saved me,)

88
00:04:16,630 --> 00:04:17,630
(I would've nearly died here.)

89
00:04:18,190 --> 00:04:19,480
(Yu Feilin didn't come this time.)

90
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,160
(I should be safe, right?)

91
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,270
All right.

92
00:04:35,070 --> 00:04:36,630
Not again!

93
00:04:45,190 --> 00:04:45,920
He Xiaoyuan,

94
00:04:46,510 --> 00:04:47,870
you stood in my way.

95
00:04:49,070 --> 00:04:50,270
Stay down there

96
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,920
and never come back.

97
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:57,390
(Why do I suddenly feel)

98
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,240
(so cold and soaked all over?)

99
00:05:24,390 --> 00:05:26,600
Zhao Boqing was right
in the last lifetime.

100
00:05:27,190 --> 00:05:28,920
I really am a fool.

101
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,600
The same trap,

102
00:05:30,750 --> 00:05:32,680
and I actually fell into it twice.

103
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,000
Fu Yang.

104
00:05:47,390 --> 00:05:48,070
Your Highness.

105
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,070
What's wrong?

106
00:05:51,750 --> 00:05:53,070
I can't breathe.

107
00:05:55,270 --> 00:05:56,270
You've been poisoned?

108
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:57,480
When?

109
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,680
I think I'm better now.

110
00:06:13,070 --> 00:06:14,040
Strange.

111
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:16,360
Good thing I brought an antidote pill.

112
00:06:17,390 --> 00:06:19,160
I know the drill by now.

113
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,480
Your Highness.

114
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,160
Why?

115
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,630
Why do you want to kill me?

116
00:06:47,390 --> 00:06:48,190
Why?

117
00:06:49,630 --> 00:06:51,430
Because you're Zhao Junyao's woman.

118
00:06:51,750 --> 00:06:54,190
I will have this realm.

119
00:06:54,870 --> 00:06:56,680
So the Crown Princess by his side

120
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,600
must be someone I put there.

121
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:15,480
You...

122
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:19,270
What did you do to me?

123
00:07:19,430 --> 00:07:20,680
Why can't I kill you?

124
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,510
What kind of sorcery is this?

125
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,920
(No wonder he didn't leave right away.)

126
00:07:29,430 --> 00:07:30,830
(So when I couldn't breathe,)

127
00:07:31,070 --> 00:07:32,040
(he couldn't breathe either.)

128
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,680
(I never expected this new cycle)

129
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,480
(to come with a bond like this.)

130
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,680
This isn't sorcery.

131
00:07:39,270 --> 00:07:40,950
It's a bond between us

132
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,870
that can never be broken.

133
00:07:44,830 --> 00:07:45,390
Absurd.

134
00:07:45,870 --> 00:07:46,560
Utter nonsense.

135
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,680
It seems you have no sense of propriety.

136
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,040
Unfortunately,

137
00:07:52,470 --> 00:07:54,750
I have no interest whatsoever

138
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,630
in a woman who throws herself at me.

139
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,430
Ow, that hurts!

140
00:08:05,190 --> 00:08:06,480
Stop!

141
00:08:16,070 --> 00:08:16,870
He Xiaoyuan.

142
00:08:17,280 --> 00:08:18,210
Are you a dog?

143
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,730
That's what you get
for trying to kill me.

144
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,040
Get up.

145
00:08:41,390 --> 00:08:42,200
Fu Yang.

146
00:08:45,510 --> 00:08:46,390
He Xiaoyuan!

147
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:48,670
Fu Yang!

148
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:49,240
Your Highness.

149
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,440
Grab her.

150
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,720
Trying to run?

151
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:53,000
He Xiaoyuan!

152
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,480
Let go of me!

153
00:08:54,670 --> 00:08:55,390
Today,

154
00:08:55,870 --> 00:08:57,240
you won't leave this place alive.

155
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:00,670
Your Highness!

156
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:02,150
Don't!

157
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:03,240
Your Highness.

158
00:09:04,030 --> 00:09:05,440
We went to all this trouble today

159
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,870
for one reason...

160
00:09:16,790 --> 00:09:17,480
Your Highness.

161
00:09:18,550 --> 00:09:19,360
You see?

162
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,630
Killing her means killing me.

163
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:24,870
What on earth

164
00:09:25,550 --> 00:09:26,870
is this sorcery?

165
00:09:27,390 --> 00:09:28,440
Take her back for now.

166
00:09:28,790 --> 00:09:29,360
Yes.

167
00:09:30,390 --> 00:09:30,790
Move.

168
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:31,630
Let go of me!

169
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:34,670
Fu Yang!

170
00:09:35,790 --> 00:09:36,750
How dare you

171
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:38,150
lay a hand on the Crown Princess?

172
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:40,360
Your Highness.

173
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:42,030
Chamberlain Shen misunderstood.

174
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:46,670
Mr. Fu was just helping me up.

175
00:09:48,630 --> 00:09:49,440
Your Highness,

176
00:09:50,030 --> 00:09:51,240
I came to the Matchmaker Shrine

177
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:53,270
to pray for a happy union for us,

178
00:09:53,750 --> 00:09:56,030
but I accidentally triggered a mechanism

179
00:09:56,030 --> 00:09:57,080
and fell into the cellar.

180
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:59,080
Fortunately, the Seventh Prince

181
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,870
and Mr. Fu came to my rescue in time.

182
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,510
(I was just trying to kill her.)

183
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,510
(Why would she)

184
00:10:03,630 --> 00:10:04,440
(cover for me?)

185
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,030
I see.

186
00:10:17,550 --> 00:10:18,870
Then I truly must thank you, Boqing.

187
00:10:19,630 --> 00:10:20,870
I just didn't expect

188
00:10:21,030 --> 00:10:23,720
you to be in the mood
to visit the Matchmaker Shrine.

189
00:10:25,270 --> 00:10:27,240
Has the impossible finally happened,

190
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:29,080
or have you fallen for some young lady?

191
00:10:29,790 --> 00:10:30,670
You're teasing me.

192
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,270
So it's true.

193
00:10:32,510 --> 00:10:33,150
Boqing,

194
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:34,440
I wonder which young lady

195
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:35,870
has caught your eye.

196
00:10:36,150 --> 00:10:37,270
When the time is right,

197
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,440
I'll bring her into the palace myself.

198
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:48,550
You're badly hurt.

199
00:10:48,910 --> 00:10:50,150
You need to return to
the palace for treatment at once.

200
00:11:03,670 --> 00:11:04,840
These servants

201
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:07,030
let my sister-in-law get so badly hurt.

202
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,550
Summon them all to the main hall.

203
00:11:08,550 --> 00:11:09,550
Yes.

204
00:11:13,870 --> 00:11:15,390
(Celestial Realm Beyond the Clouds)
Who arranged today's itinerary?

205
00:11:15,750 --> 00:11:17,270
Who attended her?

206
00:11:17,270 --> 00:11:18,630
And who delivered the messages?

207
00:11:19,750 --> 00:11:22,030
How dare you let the Crown Princess
suffer such serious injuries?

208
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,750
Every one of you deserves punishment.

209
00:11:23,750 --> 00:11:24,670
Go keep her occupied.

210
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:27,360
Don't let her actually
make her way to Qingyan Palace.

211
00:11:28,030 --> 00:11:29,000
Yes.

212
00:11:29,510 --> 00:11:31,440
Stay on your knees
and reflect on what you've done.

213
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:34,870
Your Highness.

214
00:11:37,030 --> 00:11:38,440
Why waste your anger on them?

215
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,390
The Seventh Prince

216
00:11:40,390 --> 00:11:42,670
just received some candied plums
and peach pastries from Jiangnan.

217
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,550
He said they were
specially prepared for you.

218
00:11:44,790 --> 00:11:45,480
Would you like to go try some?

219
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,080
No need.

220
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:50,790
Thank Boqing for me.

221
00:11:50,870 --> 00:11:51,670
I'll visit another time.

222
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,600
What's gotten into her?

223
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:03,240
Your Highness.

224
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:05,200
Why is the Princess
so cold toward you now?

225
00:12:06,630 --> 00:12:07,550
I don't know either.

226
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,240
It seems that three months ago,

227
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:11,790
the Princess started looking at me

228
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:13,080
as if she'd seen a ghost.

229
00:12:14,550 --> 00:12:15,240
Fu Yang.

230
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:15,720
Look.

231
00:12:15,910 --> 00:12:16,840
Isn't my new hairpin...

232
00:12:26,030 --> 00:12:26,670
What's wrong?

233
00:12:31,790 --> 00:12:32,870
Likes...

234
00:12:36,670 --> 00:12:37,750
I... I'm fine.

235
00:12:39,910 --> 00:12:40,720
I'm fine.

236
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:45,000
A woman's thoughts

237
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,510
are truly hard to fathom.

238
00:12:47,510 --> 00:12:48,790
But I'll set that aside for now.

239
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:50,600
Right now, I need to find out

240
00:12:50,870 --> 00:12:51,790
what strange trick

241
00:12:52,630 --> 00:12:54,630
He Xiaoyuan is trying to play on me.

242
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:56,670
Yes.

243
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:06,790
Xiaoyuan.

244
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,480
I had someone inspect
that hidden cellar.

245
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,240
It seems to have been built
by the former dynasty

246
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:12,480
as a refuge from disaster.

247
00:13:13,270 --> 00:13:14,630
Why would there be deadly traps inside?

248
00:13:14,870 --> 00:13:15,960
What happened in the cellar...

249
00:13:16,870 --> 00:13:18,200
was it really just an accident?

250
00:13:20,750 --> 00:13:22,030
It was an accident.

251
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:25,120
I was simply careless.

252
00:13:26,150 --> 00:13:27,270
Look at me and say it.

253
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:31,030
Your Highness.

254
00:13:32,030 --> 00:13:33,150
It really was an accident.

255
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:36,670
Fortunately, the Seventh Prince
saved me in time.

256
00:13:37,150 --> 00:13:37,750
Look,

257
00:13:37,870 --> 00:13:39,510
I'm fine now, aren't I?

258
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,120
Even after starting this life over,

259
00:13:41,750 --> 00:13:42,390
Xiaoyuan,

260
00:13:42,910 --> 00:13:44,200
you're still protecting him.

261
00:13:48,790 --> 00:13:50,150
You've been reborn too?

262
00:13:58,590 --> 00:14:00,910
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

263
00:14:01,270 --> 00:14:02,950
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

264
00:14:03,590 --> 00:14:06,590
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

265
00:14:07,110 --> 00:14:11,430
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

266
00:14:11,430 --> 00:14:14,190
♪My heart has long known♪

267
00:14:14,630 --> 00:14:16,630
♪We made a promise long ago♪

268
00:14:16,950 --> 00:14:18,550
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

269
00:14:19,230 --> 00:14:22,550
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

270
00:14:22,870 --> 00:14:25,710
♪How much must I let go♪

271
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:27,710
♪For one moment♪

272
00:14:27,990 --> 00:14:30,710
♪To hold each other close♪

273
00:14:30,950 --> 00:14:35,270
♪Would that be enough?♪
